# CR 702.21a/ADR-0028: Tomakul Honor Guard's own Ward:2 fires the moment
# ai's Lightning Bolt chooses it as a target (checkWardTriggers, trigger.go)
# -- a real triggered ability pushed onto the stack above Bolt itself,
# resolving first (CR 405.5). ai, the spell's own controller, is asked to
# pay {2} (resolveUnlessCost, effect.go, UnlessPayer$ TriggeredSourceController
# resolving to ai);
# declining leaves counterEffect (countereffect.go) to counter Bolt outright
# -- Tomakul Honor Guard takes no damage, and Bolt never resolves.
startturn ai
advance 3
tapformana ai 2 R
queue targets 1
queue action ai cast 3
queue confirmpaycost false
passpriority
